\"text-xl font-bold mb-6\">API Key Management</h1>\n        <div className=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4\">\n          {[ { label: 'Total Keys', val: 25 }, { label: 'Active', val: 18 }, { label: 'Over-scoped', val: 8 }, { label: 'Expiring', val: 3 } ].map(s => (\n            <div key={s.label} className=\"bg-white p-4 rounded border border-slate-200 shadow-sm\">\n              <div className=\"text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-tight\">{s.label}</div>\n              <div className=\"text-xl font-bold\">{s.val}</div>\n            </div>\n          ))}\n        </div>\n      </header>\n\n      <main className=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto bg-white rounded border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden\">\n        <div className=\"p-4 border-b border-slate-200 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 items-center justify-between\">\n          <div className=\"relative w-full md:w-64\">\n            <Search className=\"absolute left-2 top-2.5 w-4 h-4 text-slate-400\" />\n            <input className=\"w-full pl-9 pr-4 py-1.5 border border-slate-300 rounded text-sm\" placeholder=\"Search keys...\" />\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex gap-1 overflow-x-auto w-full md:w-auto\">\n            {['all', 'active', 'stale', 'expiring', 'over-scoped'].map(f => (\n              <button key={f} onClick={() => setFilter(f)} className={clsx(\"px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded capitalize whitespace-nowrap\", filter === f ? \"bg-slate-900 text-white\" : \"bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200\")}>{f}</button>\n            ))}\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div className=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n          <table className=\"w-full text-sm\">\n            <thead className=\"bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200\">\n              <tr>\n                <th className=\"p-3 text-left font-semibold text-slate-700\">Name</th>\n                <th className=\"p-3 text-left font-semibold text-slate-700 hidden md:table-cell\">Owner</th>\n                <th className=\"p-3 text-left font-semibold text-slate-700 hidden md:table-cell\">Scopes</th>\n                <th className=\"p-3 text-left font-semibold text-slate-700\">Status</th>\n                <th className=\"p-3 text-right\"></th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody className=\"divide-y divide-slate-100\">\n              {filteredData.map(row => (\n                <tr key={row.id} className=\"hover:bg-slate-50 cursor-pointer\" onClick={() => setDrawer(row)}>\n                  <td className=\"p-3 font-medium text-slate-900\">{row.name}</td>\n                  <td className=\"p-3 text-slate-600 hidden md:table-cell\">{row.owner}</td>\n                  <td className=\"p-3 text-slate-600 hidden md:table-cell\">{row.scopes.join(', ')}</td>\n                  <td className=\"p-3\"><StatusBadge status={row.status} /></td>\n                  <td className=\"p-3 text-right\"><MoreVertical className=\"w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 inline\" /></td>\n                </tr>\n              ))}\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </main>\n\n      {drawer && (\n        <div className=\"fixed inset-0 bg-black/20 z-50\" onClick={() => setDrawer(null)}>\n          <div className=\"absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-full md:w-96 bg-white shadow-2xl p-6 overflow-y-auto\" onClick={e => e.stopPropagation()}>\n            <div className=\"flex justify-between items-center mb-6\">\n              <h2 className=\"text-lg font-bold\">{drawer.name}</h2>\n              <button onClick={() => setDrawer(null)}><X className=\"w-5 h-5\" /></button>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"space-y-6\">\n              <div className=\"bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded border border-slate-200\">\n                <p className=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase mb-3\">Audit Trail</p>\n                <div className=\"space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-600\">\n                  <p>• Rotated 12 days ago</p>\n                  <p>• Scope 'admin' added by Alice</p